---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Cookies Policy"
  description="This website does not use tracking or advertising cookies — only technical storage required for it to function."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container legal-content">
      <p class="overline">Legal</p>
      <h1>Cookies Policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: November 2026</p>

      <h2>1. What are cookies?</h2>
      <p>
        Cookies are small files stored on your device when you visit a website. They are
        commonly used to remember your preferences, measure traffic or show advertising.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Cookies used on this Website</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>This Website does not set any cookies at present</strong> — no analytics,
        tracking or advertising cookies, and no storage on your device. Fonts, images and
        scripts are served from the Website itself, and no external services are loaded.
      </p>
      <p>
        As no cookies requiring consent are used (Article 22 of Spain's LSSI-CE), this
        Website does not display a cookie banner. If non-exempt cookies are introduced in
        the future, we will request your consent before setting them and update this
        policy.
      </p>
      <p>
        Only storage strictly necessary for the operation of the Website
        may be used (for example, to remember your language preference in the future), which
        does not require consent under Article 22 of Spain’s LSSI-CE.
      </p>

      <h2>3. If we change this policy</h2>
      <p>
        If in the future we decide to include analytics or other non-essential cookies, we
        will update this policy, implement an explicit consent mechanism before any
        non-essential cookie is set, and offer you a clear choice to accept or reject them.
      </p>

      <h2>4. How to manage cookies in your browser</h2>
      <p>
        You can configure your browser to block or delete cookies at any time. Since this
        Website does not set non-essential cookies, blocking them will not affect your
        browsing experience.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
